      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "EdgeRank Score = affinity(u,v) * weight(edge_type) * time_decay(age)\n  affinity: how often user interacted with friend (likes, comments, profile views)\n  weight: video=1.0, photo=0.8, link=0.6, status=0.4\n  time_decay: 1 / (1 + hours_since_post * 0.1)\n\nHybrid fanout:\n  Regular user (< 1M followers): LPUSH into each friend's feed list in Redis (fanout at write)\n  Celebrity (> 1M followers): post stored in hot-user table; merged with feed at READ time (pull)\n\nReal-time: Client holds open connection; server pushes delta (new post IDs) every 30s via long poll or WS",
